<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina revises 1996 GDP growth to 4.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Argentina revises 1996 GDP growth to 4.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Economy Ministry said Wednesday it revised its estimate of growth in 1996 gross domestic product to 4.3 percent from 4.4 percent.</p>
<p>The Ministry also said that it had revised its estimate of growth in gross internal fixed investment during 1996 to 8.3 percent from 8.1 percent.</p>
<p>((--Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
